          "rubricItem": "update",
          "summary": "The +55 billion adjustment for nominal wage, employment, and price growth is unsupported and appears to double-count forces already represented in the +60 billion historical-change prior; it also conflicts with the stated expectation that May's temporary boost will normalize.",
