          "severity": "blocking",
          "rubricItem": "interval",
          "summary": "The 80% interval implies a June change of about -61.7 to +282.3 billion, but the cited four-change sample ranges only from -23.5 to +164.8 billion; 'extra tail allowance' does not explain this width or strong upside asymmetry.",
